      "originalText": "emits events\nfor global + each user group\n{\n    user_id\n    game_id\n    group_id\n    scope\n    event_id\n    timestamp\n    \n}\npartitioned by (group_id, user_id) for global\nparitioned by (group_id) for other groups groups\nensures partitioning\n\nidempotent handling by using event_id\nas idempotency key",
