    {
      "id": "HuCRwy4XjJxB_YePVpO7K",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1189.9576416015625,
      "y": 1350.99609375,
      "width": 538.6395874023438,
      "height": 950,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "at",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 686004906,
      "version": 1689,
      "versionNonce": 760059754,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1767044664080,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "idempotent handling by using (group, event_id) as \nidempotency key\n \nmaintains global/group specific sorted set\n\nglobal is partitioned into multiple redis servers\nfor scaling write load\n\ngroup specific sorted set is assigned to\na single redis server via consitent hashing\n\nsize of sorted set is limited to 1500\nfor perdictable size\n\nwe maintain per minute sorted set\nkey -> leaders:{group}:{ts}\nts is epoch truncated to minute\n\nlua is used to guarantee transaction semantics\nin one TX\n\nZADD key GT score user_id:game_id\nZREMBYRANK key 0 1500\nEXPIRE key with TTL 1 hour + buffer if ZCARD is 1\n\nscore processors maintain watermark timestamps\nto ignore/drop events which are behind the watermarks\n\nwatermarks are use to maintain temporal boundaries\nthey are also used as timeouts for handling late\narriving events\n\nwatermarks are emitted every minute\n\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "idempotent handling by using (group, event_id) as \nidempotency key\n \nmaintains global/group specific sorted set\n\nglobal is partitioned into multiple redis servers\nfor scaling write load\n\ngroup specific sorted set is assigned to\na single redis server via consitent hashing\n\nsize of sorted set is limited to 1500\nfor perdictable size\n\nwe maintain per minute sorted set\nkey -> leaders:{group}:{ts}\nts is epoch truncated to minute\n\nlua is used to guarantee transaction semantics\nin one TX\n\nZADD key GT score user_id:game_id\nZREMBYRANK key 0 1500\nEXPIRE key with TTL 1 hour + buffer if ZCARD is 1\n\nscore processors maintain watermark timestamps\nto ignore/drop events which are behind the watermarks\n\nwatermarks are use to maintain temporal boundaries\nthey are also used as timeouts for handling late\narriving events\n\nwatermarks are emitted every minute\n\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "zBGqKDtmleudDuM3w6OrL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2354.3095703125,
      "y": 1425.16796875,
      "width": 789.5596313476562,
      "height": 1125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "au",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 83920118,
      "version": 1438,
      "versionNonce": 2103031722,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1767051496786,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "maintains global/group specific\n\ndaily/weekly/seasonal aggregates\n\nfor global/group:\n    for each agg window = {daily/weekly/seasonal}\n    aggregates are updated every 1 minute (after watermark event)\n    a list is maintained which contains all the minute windows\n    in the current hour \n    aggregate update tx\n        ZUNIONSTORE agg_key 2 agg_key new_key weights 1 1\n        if len(ring buffer) > 60:\n            old_key = pop left\n            ZUNIONSTORE agg_key 2 agg_key old_key weights 1 -1\n        \n        ZREMRANGEBYRANK agg_key 0 2k\n    \n    all the aggregates are updated one after other\n        5m->15m->60m\n    \n    day/week/month/season are implemented as tumbling buckets\n    on each start boundary new set is created and updated\n    with the previous watermark set\n    \n    All aggregate buckets will lag 1m + grace period    \n    \n\n  For < 10s e2e latency\n     we can maintain a global/current sorted set to keep track \n      of continous state\n        \n      This global will be of bounded size 2k, we will ZREMBYRANGEBYRANK 0 2k\n    \n     \n\n    \n\n\n    \n            \n \n        \n        \n\n ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "maintains global/group specific\n\ndaily/weekly/seasonal aggregates\n\nfor global/group:\n    for each agg window = {daily/weekly/seasonal}\n    aggregates are updated every 1 minute (after watermark event)\n    a list is maintained which contains all the minute windows\n    in the current hour \n    aggregate update tx\n        ZUNIONSTORE agg_key 2 agg_key new_key weights 1 1\n        if len(ring buffer) > 60:\n            old_key = pop left\n            ZUNIONSTORE agg_key 2 agg_key old_key weights 1 -1\n        \n        ZREMRANGEBYRANK agg_key 0 2k\n    \n    all the aggregates are updated one after other\n        5m->15m->60m\n    \n    day/week/month/season are implemented as tumbling buckets\n    on each start boundary new set is created and updated\n    with the previous watermark set\n    \n    All aggregate buckets will lag 1m + grace period    \n    \n\n  For < 10s e2e latency\n     we can maintain a global/current sorted set to keep track \n      of continous state\n        \n      This global will be of bounded size 2k, we will ZREMBYRANGEBYRANK 0 2k\n    \n     \n\n    \n\n\n    \n            \n \n        \n        \n\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
